--- !u!114 &57651820
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 57651815}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 4ab1be389fc64b3428b096ceef0d9732, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  dialogueText: {fileID: 524954944}
  fadeDuration: 0.6
  nextSceneName: SampleScene
  steps:
  - dialogue: 'My name is Tian Xiaocan. '
    imagesToFadeIn:
    - {fileID: 1854251239}
    imagesToFadeOut: []
  - dialogue: Born in a small town in the 1990s.
    imagesToFadeIn:
    - {fileID: 1440035510}
    imagesToFadeOut: []
  - dialogue: I was abandoned in the corridor of the obstetrics ward the moment I
      was born...
    imagesToFadeIn:
    - {fileID: 1071639787}
    imagesToFadeOut: []
  - dialogue: Just because I was a girl.
    imagesToFadeIn:
    - {fileID: 1223818221}
    - {fileID: 349472513}
    imagesToFadeOut: []
  - dialogue: 
    imagesToFadeIn: []
    imagesToFadeOut:
    - {fileID: 1854251239}
    - {fileID: 1440035510}
    - {fileID: 1071639787}
    - {fileID: 1223818221}
    - {fileID: 349472513}
  - dialogue: Fortunately, the adoptive parents who picked me up were the kindest
      people in the world.
    imagesToFadeIn:
    - {fileID: 1615860897}
    - {fileID: 1551910537}
    imagesToFadeOut: []
  - dialogue: They scrimped and saved to send me to school, raising me with all their
      love as if I were their own daughter.
    imagesToFadeIn:
    - {fileID: 1101829164}
    - {fileID: 1904471381}
    imagesToFadeOut: []
  - dialogue: 
    imagesToFadeIn: []
    imagesToFadeOut:
    - {fileID: 1615860897}
    - {fileID: 1551910537}
    - {fileID: 1101829164}
    - {fileID: 1904471381}
  - dialogue: "Thankfully, I wasn\u2019t stupid."
    imagesToFadeIn:
    - {fileID: 618292279}
    imagesToFadeOut: []
  - dialogue: ' I tried my utmost to get admitted to the police academy. I have long
      harbored a wish: to use police resources to find my birth parents and learn
      the truth of that year.'
    imagesToFadeIn:
    - {fileID: 1178822180}
    imagesToFadeOut: []
  - dialogue: 
    imagesToFadeIn: []
    imagesToFadeOut:
    - {fileID: 618292279}
    - {fileID: 1178822180}
  - dialogue: At my graduation defense, I chose a rather unwelcome topic. Needless
      to say, the professors were deeply dissatisfied.
    imagesToFadeIn:
    - {fileID: 1808734949}
    imagesToFadeOut: []
  - dialogue: "My supervisor asked me to change my topic, and even stated clearly:
      \u201CFailure to revise it will impact your graduation and job placement.\u201D"
    imagesToFadeIn:
    - {fileID: 2039715080}
    imagesToFadeOut: []
  - dialogue: 
    imagesToFadeIn: []
    imagesToFadeOut:
    - {fileID: 1808734949}
    - {fileID: 2039715080}
  - dialogue: I turned it down.
    imagesToFadeIn:
    - {fileID: 1774417440}
    imagesToFadeOut: []
  - dialogue: "because this is a topic I\u2019ve been researching for a long time"
    imagesToFadeIn:
    - {fileID: 1313614108}
    imagesToFadeOut: []
  - dialogue: "They said I was too stubborn...\r"
    imagesToFadeIn:
    - {fileID: 1847973753}
    imagesToFadeOut: []
  - dialogue: "\r"
    imagesToFadeIn: []
    imagesToFadeOut:
    - {fileID: 1774417440}
    - {fileID: 1313614108}
    - {fileID: 1847973753}
  - dialogue: So... my first real job...
    imagesToFadeIn:
    - {fileID: 80134485}
    imagesToFadeOut: []
  - dialogue: I was assigned to this police station in a remote county and became
      an ordinary community police officer...
    imagesToFadeIn:
    - {fileID: 248026887}
    - {fileID: 964672944}
    - {fileID: 911250015}
    imagesToFadeOut: []
  - dialogue: "Luckily\u2026 \r"
    imagesToFadeIn:
    - {fileID: 128665895}
    imagesToFadeOut: []
  - dialogue: "This county wasn\u2019t far from home.\r"
    imagesToFadeIn:
    - {fileID: 917922290}
    imagesToFadeOut: []
